@startuml
[*] --> Unassigned : No manager or staff are assigned
Unassigned --> Assigned : Manager and staff are assigned
Assigned --> Approved : Everything is approved, contract is signed
Approved --> Running : Campaign starts
Running -->* AdvertsPrepared : Adverts are being prepared
AdvertsPrepared -->* AdvertsScheduled : Adverts are being scheduled
AdvertsScheduled --> Running : Continue running campaign
Running --> Completed : All adverts have finished
Completed --> Paid : Full amount is properly paid
Completed --> Archived : Campaign is archived, staff and managers are released

[*] --> Paid : Final transition to Paid state
Paid --> [*] : Payment settlement complete

[*] --> Archived : Final transition to Archived state
Archived --> [*] : Campaign completed and staff released
@enduml
